---
/**
 * Overrides Starlight's ThemeProvider to force dark mode.
 * The default reads localStorage / system preference and toggles `data-theme`.
 * Nocturn is dark-only, so we hard-set it before first paint and render no
 * `<template>` (the theme selector is overridden away — see ThemeSelectNone).
 */
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
